{"4866610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Cube's Choice", "steam_appid": 4866610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A CUBE'S CHOICE </u></strong>is a 3D platformer where every level is tied to a song. <u>Go left, right, bob and weave</u> to reach the Wall before the music ends.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/61de8183075d068c3aebfd9da10e8e56.poster.avif?t=1787677700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/61de8183075d068c3aebfd9da10e8e56.webm?t=1787677700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/61de8183075d068c3aebfd9da10e8e56.mp4?t=1787677700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br><strong><u>UNLOCK NEW WAYS TO MOVE</u></strong> that change how you navigate each world. Abilities can be used to dodge danger and reach new paths. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/a3f62c6af3d8512d878447db076eb3c9.poster.avif?t=1787677700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/a3f62c6af3d8512d878447db076eb3c9.webm?t=1787677700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/a3f62c6af3d8512d878447db076eb3c9.mp4?t=1787677700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br><u>UNLOCK NEW MUSIC</u> and replay them in the jukebox whenever you want.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/612dde5df78475f2eb7436db3f5be27b.poster.avif?t=1787677700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/612dde5df78475f2eb7436db3f5be27b.webm?t=1787677700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/612dde5df78475f2eb7436db3f5be27b.mp4?t=1787677700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br><u>DISCOVER HIDDEN SKINS</u> throughout the levels and change the look of your cube. Some skins are placed off the main path, rewarding players who slow down, explore, and search each world more carefully. Some skins even have a hidden secret!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/0834ff48da9da22e26b7f4c2e2f3aeaf.poster.avif?t=1787677700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/0834ff48da9da22e26b7f4c2e2f3aeaf.webm?t=1787677700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866610/extras/0834ff48da9da22e26b7f4c2e2f3aeaf.mp4?t=1787677700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br>Through soft, symbolic storytelling, A Cube’s Choice explores what it means to face insurmountable walls and what philosophies we can use to overcome them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is shaped by its song, changing the atmosphere, rhythm, and challenges of the world around you. Push straight for the goal, or slow down and explore how each song affects the space. But remember, <u>time isn't gonna stop though</u>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A CUBE'S CHOICE </u></strong>is a 3D platformer where every level is tied to a 